Z||000001||DecadenceR||11-22-2001||10:30 AM||||It's prety funny that I actually got a chance to sicn on today and saw this post. Thank you for thinking of me.<P>For anyone that would like to write ( I love mail) my address is as follows:<P>Pvt. Richards, Stephen 402<BR>E-Co 2nd BN 19th IN Regt. ITB<BR>9050 Kinsman Drive<BR>Ft. Benning, GA 31905<P>I look foward to hearing from some of you, and talking to you again when I get home! Have a good holiday!!!!<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/SigPic.jpg">  <BR>AIM - DecadenceR<BR>"For though I cannot fly, I'm not content to crawl..."||||reg||1
